-# Research Roadmap vNEXT: Constraint Memory and Latent Energy Correction
-
-**Milestone:** 2026.08.575  
-**Planning date:** 2026-08-25  
-**Experiment range:** Exp6592-Exp6603  
-**Execution file:** research-roadmap-next.yaml  
-**Status:** planned
